WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:02.930
What just happened?

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.500
The clouds were so thick, but all 
of a sudden, there's light...

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:13.450
<i>Is this a coincidence, or something 
made inevitable by the hand of God?</i>

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:18.020
<i>Either way, I hope the image of God 
in each of their hearts</i>

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:23.190
<i>is a kind one, filled with 
compassion and generosity.</i>

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.380
I used to watch the Holy Capital 
from here all the time.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:48.780
Looking back, it's hard to believe 
I lived in such a small room.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:54.690
But it was a great place to live.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.670
It was safer than anywhere else.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.610
But I can't come back here anymore.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.930
Now that I've tasted the freedom of flight...

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.600
I'm sorry, brother.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.770
I'm leaving.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.100
I'm going to see the world.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.130
I see.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:24.120
But when you're tired,
come home to rest your wings.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.450
I'll be here, waiting for you.

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.630
Brother...

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.800
Thank you for everything.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.990
And... I'm sorry.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:39.050
You had to give up so much for me...

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:41.630
Just to protect me.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:43.460
Don't worry about it.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:45.940
It was just a question of priorities.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.320
I knew...

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:53.770
...that you didn't really want to be the 
commander of the Holy Palace's guard.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.690
Do you regret it?

00:01:58.470 --> 00:01:59.750
There's one thing...

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:03.300
There's one thing I regret.

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:09.810
The fact that I was never able to 
celebrate with you on your birthday.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:16.560
That's why you decided to quit?

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.320
Feyle-san didn't know what to do.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.040
I'll be back for my birthday next year.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.700
When that day comes, throw me a party.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.110
Sure.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.500
I'm off, brother!

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:43.000
If you ever need my help, come to me.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:47.930
From now on, I want to do what I can...

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.030
Not just pass prayers along to God.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:56.440
If there's anything I can do, call me, too!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:01.040
Not that there's much I can do on my own.

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:01.980
No...

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:07.660
You have no idea how much your 
coming here meant to me.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:13.610
Just having you here to 
listen kept me going.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.810
Maybe...

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:21.520
this is how the people who 
gave me their prayers felt.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:26.890
I'm sure there's something only you can do.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.410
Thank you.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:35.880
May God watch over you on your journey.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.790
Thank you.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.650
All right, let's go!

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.590
Okay!

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.390
Jamo...

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.390
Jamo...

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.770
Jamo, jamo, ja...

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.770
Jamo...

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.520
Hey!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.550
Toto!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.210
Jamo-san!

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.960
We're back!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.820
I'm so glad, jamo!

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:29.320
Wait! Wait!

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.880
Okay, I'll be going.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.250
Sure. Thanks for everything.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.830
Thank you!

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.580
Next time we meet, let's travel together.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.920
Yeah. See you around.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:51.730
All right, we're heading back to the Kingdom!

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.260
Okay!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.410
<b>The Healer and the Friend in the Bottle</b>

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.630
This is everything.

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.340
Thank you, jamo.

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.470
You're a lifesaver, jamo.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:22.660
Jamo-san, when will you be leaving next?

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:25.160
Well, jamo, you see...

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:29.900
It looks like my wagon's in 
worse shape than I thought, jamo.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.210
That was indeed a long journey, jamo.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:36.980
So I decided to get it repaired, jamo.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:39.590
How long will that take?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:44.850
I don't know, but it'll take a while, jamo.

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.290
I see.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.230
This is goodbye for a while, jamo.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.200
Yeah.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.190
Thank you for everything.

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:55.700
Be well, jamo!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.660
I remember you!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:03.690
It's Mr. Fluffball!

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.410
Oh, it's you guys!

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:08.630
The ones from the general store!

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.060
It's been so long!

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:12.260
It sure has!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.730
So you're back!

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:14.630
Yup.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:18.650
Oh, you're okay with monsters now, huh?

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.570
Yeah...

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:24.500
You've grown up since I last saw you.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.570
Did Merc-chan get her memories back?

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.660
No, unfortunately.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:34.640
You knew you weren't going to 
find them that easily, right?

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.020
We're back to square one.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.670
There's no need to rush, miss.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.910
Take your time.

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.890
That's part of the fun 
of traveling, he says.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:51.280
Thank you.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.140
Bye!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.230
Come by the store soon.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.960
Thank you.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:03.720
We're back in the Kingdom, so let's go home.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:08.820
We can eat some of Mom's home cooking
 and think about what to do next.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.480
Okay!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:16.960
Come to think of it, Toto's never
 been to my house, has he?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:23.480
I'm sure your mom will think 
he's a snack you brought home!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.970
Mom!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.120
We're back!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.520
Yuu!

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.180
We're back!

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:58.670
What's up? You surprised me!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.950
Welcome home!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.890
Have you gotten a little taller?

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:10.470
I c-can't breathe...

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.990
I was just away from home for a little!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:16.800
You barely sent any letters!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.130
Sorry...

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:20.930
Who's that?

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.520
That's Toto!

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:27.360
It's hard to believe you 
came back with a monster.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:31.220
You're starting to take after your dad.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.390
I've still got a long way to go.

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.110
That was great.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.870
I ate so much.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.660
Are you leaving on another trip?

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:49.640
Hmm...

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.230
Well, I'll be home for a while.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.250
I see.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.310
Yuu-san!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.550
Mom, did you see Yuu-san?

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.740
Yuu?

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:14.860
No. Is he still in bed?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.420
He's not.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.810
I don't see Toto, either.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:25.340
Jeez! Where could he have gone that 
he'd leave a pretty girl like me behind?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.190
I guess he didn't like the fact

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:35.630
that I forced him to go on a 
journey to find my memories.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.170
Hello?

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.680
Thank you for always bringing me these.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.960
See you next time!

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:52.160
Mr. Goldory, I need your 
help with something!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.780
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.900
Did Yuu-san really go this way?

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:18.660
I've never been here before.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:28.480
Sorry for bothering you 
while you were working!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:31.100
Thanks!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:36.390
I outsmarted you, Yuu-san!

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:41.440
Time to see what you're up to in this cave!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:52.340
It's too dark to see.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:57.080
I could easily imagine there 
being monsters here.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.470
I wonder if Merc's suspicious.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.890
I hope she didn't get any weird
 ideas about me being gone.

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:17.610
Rain...

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.390
It'd be nice if it stopped
by the time I leave.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:28.180
Let's see if I can find some Crowvises 
and get some gems from them.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:32.390
Yuu-san!

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:36.020
There's a monster I want to meet!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.410
A monster?

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:42.370
It's a shiny monster called a Crowvis!

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:46.880
It was on a list of 100 must-see monsters!

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:51.130
And it lives close to here, too!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:54.320
It's supposed to shine like a ring.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:57.270
I want to meet one someday!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.430
Pay attention!

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:01.970
I'm not interested.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:05.510
Let's go see it together!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.700
Well, Toto?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:21.510
Yuu-san? Toto? Where are you?

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:25.620
The exit!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.770
It's raining...

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:39.240
And this isn't the exit, it's a dead end!

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.490
I'm lost...

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:53.650
Is that voice... the Crowvis?

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.930
Wh-What?

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.240
Is this the Crowvis?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:15.400
That's not what it looked
like in the book at all.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.320
Yeah, I know.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:20.840
Its leg is trapped under 
a rock, and it can't move.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.190
But first...

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:27.200
I need to calm it down!

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.930
Now you're not stuck anymore.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.180
Huh? Toto?

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:38.060
Jeez...

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:47.440
I kept going until I got here,

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:51.950
but I guess I can't do anything on my own.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:15:01.950
Hey, where are you taking us?

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:04.870
The exit?

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:15.910
Go on a journey...

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:18.480
Don't go...

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.150
Go on a journey...

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:25.020
Don't go...

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:27.890
Go on a...

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.010
Let's go, then.

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:34.860
Yuu-san!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.860
What are you doing here?

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.380
I know...

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:46.010
...that you really don't 
want to go on a journey.

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:47.720
Merc...

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.710
If you're not saying it just for my sake,

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:54.220
then just come out and say it.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:16:00.230
There's no need to go on a 
dangerous journey just for me.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.030
After this journey,

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:18.360
I started thinking I want 
to pursue my dad's dream.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:25.040
Thanks to you, I was able to change.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:34.440
You took me to see the outside world.

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:44.380
So, Merc...

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.300
Come on a journey with me.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:56.730
You hands have gotten so big.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.580
If you're the one inviting me,

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:04.460
I have no reason to refuse.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:07.190
Thank you.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.460
No, thank you.

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:16.690
I'm glad I met you, Yuu-san!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.280
I'm glad I met you too, Toto.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:30.760
Why did you come here, anyway?

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:31.980
Oh, um...

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:33.600
Well, uh...

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:39.900
It's... you know... your birthday... today.

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.310
I decided it when I was a kid.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:49.120
It was the first day you smiled 
when you talked to me.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.900
It's beautiful!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:13.840
These flowers change color in the sunlight!

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:16.890
Is this what the Crowvis wanted to show me?

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:21.050
Yuu-san, did you want me to see this?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:24.130
Of course!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.420
Right, Toto?

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:28.090
Play along!

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:35.130
Merc!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:39.200
Happy birthday!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:52.680
Hey, why are you leaving on a journey, Dad?

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.090
Is it because Mom's scary?

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.160
No way.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:01.370
Well, I did buy her a ring to
 keep her happy, though.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.690
Then why?

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:05.500
Well...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.460
Because I'm searching 
while I'm on a journey.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:18.190
For a world where monsters and 
humans can live hand in hand.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.100
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:29.730
I'm glad we got a new job 
working for a caravan.

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:31.170
Yeah.

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:36.840
I can't wait to see who we're 
traveling with this time.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:37.570
Yeah.

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:43.030
Two Jamo-sans!

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:47.460
This is Moja, my twin brother, jamo.

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:49.140
Nice to meet you, moja.

00:22:49.140 --> 00:22:50.320
Twin?

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:55.480
We were just looking for 
a new healer to guard us, moja.

00:22:55.480 --> 00:22:58.130
You'll be a huge help, moja!

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:05.980
Okay, let's go!

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.820
Yeah!

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:12.370
Off we go, moja!

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:14.460
Let's have a great time!

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:15.660
Yeah!

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:24.960
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>
